      "message": "Once you run \u0027ectool led power auto\u0027, any power state transition should restore the signal.\n\nThis is a known limitation. On Fizz, LED is not run by a task or a hook like other boards typically do. It\u0027s run by a deferred call. This saves CPU and RAM resources. ectool led command is handled by the common LED code. So, it\u0027s a bit tedious to fix it.\n\nIf this is affecting a factory test, please file a bug.",
